From 9ebdeb65b9ac4699ce44cb0fa96517b0e148b59b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:28:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/29] Build against Plasma 6.7 and Qt 6.10

Droidian next (102) moved to Plasma 6.7.4 and Qt 6.10.2 but still has no
plasma-mobile-wf, so its metapackage depends on the never published
plasma-mobile-wf-config-hwcomposer.  Three API changes stop the build:
qmlRegisterAnonymousType is no longer pulled in transitively, KScreen
dropped Output::isPrimary in favour of the output priority, and the KWin
task switcher effect does not build against the KWin 6.7 output API.  The
Wayfire variant does not run KWin and the packaging never ships that
effect, so it is left out.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
